    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d361">

                <pb facs="0503" n="423" xml:id="pg423"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister of Foreign Relations of
                            Salvador to Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >San Salvador</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1901-09-15"><hi rendition="#italic">September 15,
                        1901</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The people and Government of Salvador send through me to the American Government
                    the expression of their profound sympathy in the death of its illustrious
                    President McKinley.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Francisco A. Reyes</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Minister of Foreign
                    Relations.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
